amends the
<a href="https://transparency.fb.com/en-gb/policies/other-policies/meta-pay-terms-and-conditions/">Meta Pay Merchant Terms and Conditions</a>,
such amendments will be effective as of the date of posting by
Meta. Your continued use of Meta Pay on your Store after
the
amended <a href="https://transparency.fb.com/en-gb/policies/other-policies/meta-pay-terms-and-conditions/">Meta Pay Merchant Terms and Conditions</a>
