the law, breach this agreement or go against the rights of a third
party. The Service is provided on an &quot;as is&quot; and &quot;as available&quot; basis.
We provide no warranties and our liability is limited in the event of
errors or interruptions.</p></aside>

<ol>
<li>You expressly understand and agree that, to the extent permitted by
applicable laws, Shopify and its suppliers will not be liable for
any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential or
