<li>Your Materials and your use of Shop must comply at all
times with our <a href="https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shop/eligibility">Shop App Merchant Guidelines</a>,
these Terms of Service, the Additional Terms, all other
applicable policies and guidelines, and applicable law.</li>
<li>As in other areas of the Service, Shopify is not obligated to
